# Flopsie, Bumi's Buddy: the limit applies to the power a creature has as blockers are declared (CR 509.1b), and Llanowar Elves, 1/1 with Flopsie's
# counter a 2/2, is under it only once Giant Growth makes it a 5/5 (T3, before blocks): Bot2's two Ornithopters may then not both block it (the
# refusal) but one may. Bot1 casts Llanowar Elves then Flopsie on turn 1 (Forest for the Elves, Black Lotus and three Moxen for Flopsie).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Flopsie, Bumi's Buddy
Giant Growth
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flopsie, Bumi's Buddy.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Flopsie, Bumi's Buddy.Power = 5
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 5
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter#1 > Llanowar Elves; Ornithopter#2 > Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter#1 > Llanowar Elves)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Damage = 0
